[
{ type: upgrade
  maximum_version: "1.5.0"
  message: <<EOM
KeyKey 1.5.0 replaces its input engine with Guanyinma, a shared Rust core.
Custom phrases and learning are now kept in guanyinma-user.db; the data of
the old engine is neither read nor imported, and it is not deleted.

Export your custom phrases with the old version before upgrading, then add
them again with keykey-user-phrases.
EOM
}
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
To use KeyKey, run Fcitx 5 and add the KeyKey input methods in its
configuration. Applications find Fcitx through these variables, set for
example in ~/.xinitrc or ~/.xprofile:

  export GTK_IM_MODULE=fcitx
  export QT_IM_MODULE=fcitx
  export XMODIFIERS=@im=fcitx
EOM
}
]
